^{:go/pos {:doc [244 1] :tok-pos [252 1]}} (go/type ^{:go/pos {:name-pos [252 6]}} finPendEntry "The moment at a frame's return (the user's decision of 2026-11-22, doc/JOURNAL.md: \"Design: 222\"'s DECISION 1, (b)): an\ninstance whose class has a __del__, made while a frame runs, is noted on its thread with that frame's depth\n(finPendAdd); when a frame that deep returns, one Go collection asks whether it died with the frame (a temporary of its\nvalue stack, a local of its own) and its __del__ runs before the caller goes on (finAtReturn), the moment reference\ncounting gives it when no reference outlives the frame. The gate is the thread's finPendDepth against its depth, one\nload and a compare at each return, false while nothing is noted. A survivor is noted again at the caller's depth, at\nmost finPendChecks times, then left to the next collection; at most finPendMax notes a thread; the collections' time is\nthe moment at del's (finSpent's budget: a tenth of the elapsed wall time and 50 ms), past it the notes are dropped.\n" ^{:go/pos {:lbrace [252 26] :rbrace [257 1] :struct [252 19]}} (struct
